        "like_count": 55,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 2,
        "retweet_count": 1
      },
      "text": "Taking the extreme view, @Quibi is what you get if you take TikTok and trade a network effect for a scale economy (two-sided creator network vs. fixed production costs).\n\nIt feels like a classic example of premature investment before discovering if you have a product ppl love.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1247379569910247427"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2020-04-06T23:51:52.000Z",
