      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "1247187847133552640",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "I don't agree with the \"Quibi is competing with Netflix not TIkTok/YouTube\" argument.\n\nQuibi is competing for bite sized snippets of time that people spend waiting in line, on the bus, etc. That consumption pattern from consumers is currently taken up by TikTok/YT.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1247311091505311744"
